OL,4,G1400FTrevor Nelson
OL,5,     GTrevor is bringing you some of
OL,6,     Gthe best music from across the
OL,7,     Gdecades to get you through the
OL,8,     Gafternoon.
OL,9,G1600FAngela Scanlon
OL,10,     GAngela Scanlon gets you through
OL,11,     Gteatime with giggles and some fab
OL,12,     Gmusic. Plus, she reveals the
OL,13,     Gphrase for Totally Teavoted and a
OL,14,     Glistener plays Jukebox Jam.
OL,15,G1830FAngela Scanlon's Half Wower
OL,16,     GAngela plays the biggest and best
OL,17,     Gtunes to get you up dancing!
OL,18,G1900FJo Whiley's Shiny Happy Playlist
OL,19,     GJo brings her Shiny Happy
OL,20,     GPlaylist, 30 minutes of feelgood
OL,21,     Gmusic from 7-7.30pm to soundtrack
OL,22,     Glisteners' weekday evening.
